# The control for p6_tree_speed_fast_control: the same run with a planted
# cap, so that above 1x a frame owes no more ticks than 1x would
# (tree.html?nodes=24&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=1&physics_plant_owed=1x;
# physics catalog plan, ruled 2026-10-06, "Cap control"). 50x then runs no
# faster than the page's 1x while the budget has room, and must miss the bar.
assert snap ready == true
assert snap physics-speed == 1
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
assert snap physics-paused == false
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
settle 4
mark-pace one-x
assert snap physics-effective-marked >= 0.001
click role:combobox Speed
settle 1
click role:option 50x
settle 2
assert snap physics-speed == 50
timing start speed-fast-control-capped
settle 4
timing stop
log-physics fast-control-capped
log-pace fast-control-capped
# The plant took: 50x ran about as fast as 1x, far from 50 times it.
assert snap physics-effective-over-marked <= 2
assert snap physics-effective-over-bar <= 0.99
assert snap finite == true
log p6 speed fast control capped complete
